title: "AURORA: A Formal Alignment Dossier and Open Research Platform"
abstract: >
  AURORA is a multi-volume formal alignment dossier covering constitutional
  kernel architecture, RealityAnchor trajectory monitoring (blind and
  velocity-aware variants), the CIPHER adversarial evasion experiment, a
  HiveMind collective intelligence simulation, and a TimeDilationEngine
  for computational temporal distortion. The dossier is presented as an
  open research platform with explicit falsification criteria, stated
  assumptions, and a status table for each claim. It does not claim to
  have solved alignment.
